---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy - 100% Client-Side Architecture | AspectRatioKit"
  description="Learn about AspectRatioKit's zero-upload privacy architecture. All image processing happens locally in your web browser. GDPR & CCPA compliant."
  canonicalPath="/privacy"
  activeNav="/privacy"
>
  <div class="py-16 bg-[#fafafa] dark:bg-[#0a0a0a] border-b border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#262626] transition-colors duration-150">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-[#141414] border border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#262626] text-xs font-mono uppercase text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 mb-4">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
        <span>Zero Server Uploads Guaranteed</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#171717] dark:text-white">
        Privacy Policy &amp; Security Architecture
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#4d4d4d] dark:text-[#a1a1a1]">
        Last updated: September 2026. Your privacy is built directly into our codebase.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 space-y-10 text-sm text-[#4d4d4d] dark:text-[#a1a1a1] leading-relaxed">
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white">1. Local In-Browser Processing (Zero-Upload Guarantee)</h2>
      <p>
        When you drag, drop, or select an image on <strong>AspectRatioKit</strong>, the file is read exclusively by your local web browser using the standard <code class="text-xs font-mono bg-white dark:bg-[#1c1c1c] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#262626] text-[#171717] dark:text-white">FileReader API</code> and <code class="text-xs font-mono bg-white dark:bg-[#1c1c1c] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#262626] text-[#171717] dark:text-white">HTML5 Canvas API</code>.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>No image data, pixel buffer, or EXIF metadata is ever transmitted across the internet to any server, cloud storage bucket, or third-party service.</strong> All calculations happen in local system RAM.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white">2. No Storage of Personal Visual Data</h2>
      <p>
        Because AspectRatioKit has no image upload endpoint or database storage mechanism for uploads, it is mathematically and technically impossible for us to view, store, index, sell, or retain your personal photographs, design mockups, or video assets.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white">3. Cookies and Local Storage</h2>
      <p>
        We do not use tracking cookies, behavioral ad pixels, or third-party marketing beacons.
      </p>
      <p>
        We only utilize the browser's standard <code class="text-xs font-mono bg-white dark:bg-[#1c1c1c] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#262626] text-[#171717] dark:text-white">localStorage</code> to remember your chosen theme preference (System, Light, or Dark). This data remains strictly on your local device and is never synchronized to our servers.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white">4. GDPR and CCPA Compliance</h2>
      <p>
        Because we do not collect, process, or sell personal data or identifiable imagery, AspectRatioKit adheres by design to the principles of data minimization specified in the European Union General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA).
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white">5. Independent Verification</h2>
      <p>
        You can independently verify our zero-upload architecture at any moment: open your web browser's Developer Tools (<kbd class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-white dark:bg-[#1c1c1c] border border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#262626] rounded font-mono text-xs">F12</kbd> or <kbd class="px-1.5 py-0.5 bg-white dark:bg-[#1c1c1c] border border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#262626] rounded font-mono text-xs">Cmd+Option+I</kbd>), navigate to the <strong>Network</strong> tab, and drag a photo into the tool. You will observe zero outbound HTTP requests for file content.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white">6. Contact for Privacy Inquiries</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions or security inquiries regarding our privacy standards, you can contact us through our <a href="/contact" class="text-[#0070f3] hover:underline">Contact Page</a> or via email at <code class="text-xs font-mono bg-white dark:bg-[#1c1c1c] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#262626] text-[#171717] dark:text-white">privacy@aspectratiokit.pages.dev</code>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
